<title>UK: BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at Sudirman Cup world</p>
<p>team badminton championship on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Group 4A</p>
<p> United States    5    Bulgaria    0  Poland	     4</p>
<p>Iceland 0</p>
<p>    Group 5A Portugal	   4    Belgium     1</p>
<p> Belarus	    4    France	1</p>
<p>Group 5B</p>
<p> Peru		 3    Kazakhstan  2</p>
<p> Ireland	    4    Spain	 1</p>
<p>Group 6A</p>
<p> Slovenia	   3    Guatemala   2</p>
<p> Sri Lanka	  4    Pakistan    1</p>
</text>
